# Ignore everything
*

# Allow the .gitignore and README files
!.gitignore
!README.md

# Allow Assignment 1/Code
!Assignment 1/
Assignment 1/*
!Assignment 1/Code/
!Assignment 1/Code/**

# Allow Assignment 2/Code
!Assignment 2/
Assignment 2/*
!Assignment 2/Code/
!Assignment 2/Code/**

# Specifically ignore images and PDFs within any allowed folder
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.pdf
*.zip
.DS_Store

# Ignore binaries and build artifacts
*.o
*.out
Assignment 2/Code/Assignment2exe
Assignment 2/Code/exercise3
Assignment 2/Code/exercise6
Assignment 2/Code/exercise7
Assignment 2/Code/test
Assignment 2/Code/test6
Assignment 2/Code/test7
